<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">YAK - Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">YAKOBO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc1">YAKOBO</para>
  <para style="mt1">YAKOBO</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA</para>
  <para style="ip">Mmeni pee de di kyɛ, Yesu aliema Yakobo, bɔ ne ɔla Kristofoɛ asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Yerusalem ne noa ne, ye yeɛ ɔhworɔle krataa he ɔ. Ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Yerusalem kɔyɛ 60-61 Y.A.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> Ebiemɔ ka kyɛ Yakobo nwomaa ne ayɛ te kyɛ Anyandera nwomaa ne wɔ Kristofoɛ Tworɔnzɛm (Apam Foforɛ) nanu. Krataa he de, Yakobo hworɔ mane Kristofoɛ bɔ babɔ bapete Wiase mukoraati ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">Yak 1:1</ref></char>) Sɔ nwomaa ne maa Kristofoɛ nwu kyɛbɔ odikyɛ bɛbɔ bɛ bra. Nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ nu bie yeɛ ɛhe:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kyɛbɔ bɛkɔfa edwirɛ bɔ bɛte ne bɛkɔyɛ adwuma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:22-25">Yak 1:22-25</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kyɛbɔ bɛkɔfa nyumaa bɛkɔboka bɛ gyidie so (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-17">Yak 2:14-17</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kyɛbɔ bɛkoli bɛ temverema so (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:5-10">Yak 3:5-10</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ná banya nningyein nwo aboterɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔfale nningyein pee yɛle ndotohoɛ, kyɛbɔ ne ye atiefoɛ nemɔ konya asetena nu suahu ahoroɛ kofi ye krataa nanu ɔ. Bɛ bɔ Yakobo hworɔle ye krataa ne mane bɛ ne, né beyia ɔtaeɛ paa, na ne wahia bɛ nu biemɔ koso. Né sɔ Kristofoɛ nanu biemɔ yɛ bɛ nningyein te kyɛ wiasefoɛ, yeti, Yakobo bokale bɛ maa bɛnwuni bɔ Nyameɛ pena kyɛ bɛyɛ, na ne ɛhene kɔboka maa bɛkoli tebea nanwo dwumaa.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Gyidie nwo nzɔhwɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-18">1:2-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tie edwirɛ ne, na fa yɛ adwuma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:19-27">1:19-27</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyeyemuɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Gyidie bɔ nyumaa bokka so (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nea wɔ dwudwolɛ yé (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyanza bɔ ofi anwuro (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:13-18">3:13-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Wiase adamvoa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nnɛ hoɔhoa wɔ nwo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:13-17">4:13-17</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Asikafoɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5:1-6</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyameɛ hyira bɛ bɔ bemia bɛ nye begyina nu ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:7-12">5:7-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Gyidie mbaeɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:13-18">5:13-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Boka ɔbɔnefoɛ ma ɔsakra (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:19-20">5:19-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Me Yakobo, nde Nyameɛ ne Yesu Kristo akoaa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">metworɔ krataa he mekɔma abusuakue 12 bɔ babɔ bapete ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Mekyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Nniema mɔ, sɛ ɛmɔyia nzɔhwɛ a, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye paa,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ ɔte anigye dwirɛ.”</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ, sɛ bɛsɔ ɛmɔ gyidie bɛnea a, ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔfa animia bɛkogyina ɔhaw nu. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ɛmɔma animia yie ye adwuma, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ koli mu wɔ nikye biala nu, bɔ hwee ngohia ɛmɔ ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie hia nyanza a, ma obisa Nyameɛ, na ɔkɔma ye bie. Ofikyɛ ofia ye kunu kyɛ ebiala nikye, bɔ animguaseɛ biala bokka so ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Nakoso ɔfa gyidie bisa, nnɛmaa ye adwene nu yɛ ye naa, ofikyɛ sona bɔ ye adwene nu yɛ ye naa ne, ɔte kyɛ ɛpo asorɔkye bɔ mvrama fa ye di akɔ-ne-aba ne. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Nnɛmaa sɔ sona ne nya adwene lle kyɛ okonya nikye bie kofi Awurade berɛ; <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />ɔte ebie bɔ y'adwene yɛ ye nyɔ-nyɔ, na ɔngora nzi ye adwene pi wɔ nikye biala nu.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Aliemaa bɔ ɔyɛ anwunvo<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɔ olle bie.”</char></note> ne, ma oli ahurusi kyɛ bama ye so, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />na sikaniɛ koso, oli ahurusi kyɛ babrɛ ye ase, ofikyɛ ɔkɔpɛ nu kɔhɔ te kyɛ flawa. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Kyɛbɔ eyia fite a, ɔbɔ gyein-gyein yera ndire ma ye flawa poro gua, ná ye anwo nyemene sɛkye ne, sɔ ala yeɛ sikaniɛ kɔyakyi ye ahonyadeɛ berɛ kɔhɔ ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Sona bɔ omia ye nye gyina nzɔhwɛ nu ne, onya anigye, ofikyɛ sɛ ɔkora gyina nzɔhwɛ nanu a, okonya ngoa abotire bɔ Awurade ahyɛ bɔ kyɛ ɔkɔfa kɔma bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ ye ne. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie yia nzɔhwɛ a, nnɛmaa ɔka kyɛ, “Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔsɔ me nea ɔ.” Ofikyɛ ɛngɔhora ngɔfa nikye tɛɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɔne.”</char></note> ngɔsɔ Nyameɛ ngɔnea, na ye koso, ɔnzɔ ebiala nnea. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Mmom bɔ ɔsɔ ebie nea yeɛ ole ye bɔbɔ ye akɔnnɔ bɔ ɔtwetwe ye, na ɔlaka-laka ye ne. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Sɛ akɔnnɔ ne nwonzɛ a, ɔwo bɔne, na sɛ bɔne ne nyi a, ɔwo ewue.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Aliemaa mɔ, nnɛmɔ maa bɛlaka-laka ɛmɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Akyɛdeɛ pa, ne akyɛdeɛ bɔ odi mu biala fi anwuro; ofi kanea Baba ne berɛ, ye de ɔnzesa, na ɔtte kyɛ wawoɛ bɔ ɔkakyi-kakyi ne. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Ye bɔbɔ ye pɛ nu yeɛ ɔfale nahorɛ dwirɛ ne wole yɛ, kyɛ yɛɛyɛ ye abɔdeɛ nu nikye bɔ oli moa.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔtie ɛhe yé: Ebiala yɛ ndɛ tie edwirɛ, nnɛmaa ɔpere ye nwo dwudwo, na nnɛmaa ɔfɛ yaa ndɛ, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />ofikyɛ sona fɛ yaa a, ɔnyɛ nikye bɔ ɔtengyɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nye so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ofikyɛ sona yaa nná Nyameɛ tenenee ali.”</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Yeti, ɛmɔgyi efiɛ biala ne bɔne mukoraati bɛgua, na ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase ma bɛlua edwirɛ ne wɔ ɛmɔ nu, na ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔhora kole ɛmɔ ngoa ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Ɛmɔfa edwirɛ ne bɛyɛ adwuma, ná nnɛmɔ tie ye mbaen, wanyɛ sɔ a, né ɛmɔ laka-laka ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Ofikyɛ ebie bɔ otie edwirɛ ne, na ɔmva nnyɛ adwuma ne, ɔte kyɛ ebie bɔ ɔnea ye nyunu wɔ ahwehwɛ nu. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Ɔnea yie a, né wahɔ, na ɛberɛ nala, ye wora fi kyɛbɔ ɔte ne. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Nakoso bɔ ɔpena ahofadie mmeraa bɔ ɔte pɛ, na ɔtena nu ne, ɔte ebie bɔ ɔfa edwirɛ ne yɛ adwuma, na ɔtte ebie bɔ otie edwirɛ ne a, né ye wora afi ɔ; na ye nye kɔgye kyɛ ɔyɛ sɔ ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Sɛ ebie nwu ye nwo kyɛ ɔsõ Nyameɛ, ná ɔnnea ye dwudwolɛ yé a, né ɔlaka-laka ye nwo.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Y'ahone.”</char></note> Sɔ sona ne, ye som te mbaen. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Nyamesom bɔ odi mu, na efiɛ biala nne ye nwo wɔ yɛ Nyameɛ, ne yɛ Baba ne nyunu ɛhe: Kyɛ ebie kɔnea nyisiaa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyanga.”</char></note> ne akunafoɛ bɔ bɛ nwo ahyere bɛ ne, na wahwe ye nwo wafi wiase ngekayɛɛ nwo.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Nniema mɔ, gyidie bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ Awurade Yesu Kristo bɔ ɔte y'anuonyam nanu ne, nnɛmɔfa nyeyemuɛ bɛbata ye nwo. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Sɛ ebie bɔ owura sikaa kɔkorɛ kaa ne atadeɛ kama-kama ba nekaa bɔ ɛmɔyia nu ne, na hianiɛ bie bɔ owura atadeɛ fiɛ koso ba berɛ, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />ná ɛmɔfa nidie bɛma bɔ owura atadeɛ pa ne, na ɛmɔka bɛkyire ye kyɛ: “Baatena bia pa he aso,” na hianiɛ ne de, ɛmɔka bɛkyire ye kyɛ: “Gyina berɛ” anaa “tena me gya bo wa” a, <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />aso ɛhe ngyire kyɛ ɛmɔ ayɛ nyeyemuɛ, na ɛmɔ ayɛ mmenia bɔ bɛbu ndɛngyea? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Nniema mɔ bɔ ɛmɔla m'ahone so, ɛmɔtie. Nná bɛ bɔ wahia bɛ wɔ wiase nanu ne, yeɛ Nyameɛ aye bɛ kyɛ bɛɛyɛ asikafoɛ wɔ gyidie nanu ne? Na nná bɛ yeɛ bekonya ahennie bɔ wahyɛ bɔ kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ ye ne konya ye ne? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Nakoso ɛmɔbu ahiafoɛ animtia. Aso, nná asikafoɛ yeɛ bɛhyɛ ɛmɔ so ne, na nná bɛ yeɛ bɛtwe ɛmɔ bɛkɔ kɔɔto ne? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Dumaa pa bɔ Nyameɛ afa ama ɛmɔ ne, nná bɛ yeɛ bɛka mmusue dwirɛ bɛfa ye nwo ne?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Mmeraa bɔ ɔte piri wɔ Tworɔnzɛm nanu ne ka kyɛ: “Dɔ wɔ mmango kyɛ wɔ nwo,” sɛ ɛmɔdi so a, ye de ɛmɔ ayɛ nikye. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Nakoso sɛ ɛmɔkɔ so bɛyɛ nyeyemuɛ a, né ɛmɔ ayɛ bɔne, na mmeraa ne bu ɛmɔ fɔ kyɛ ɛmɔte mmeratofoɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Sona biala bɔ odi mmeraa namukoraati so, ná okobu enu komapɛ po so ne, wali ye mukoraati nwo fɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ofikyɛ bɔ ɔhane kyɛ, “Nnɛsɛkye agyaa” ne, ye ala yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ, “Nnɛdi Awue” ne. Yeti sɛ anzɛkye agyaa, ná edi awue a, ato mmeraa. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Yeti, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ dwudwolɛ ne ɛmɔ nneyɛɛ hyire kyɛ, ahofadie mmeraa yeɛ bɛkɔfa bɛkobu ɛmɔ atɛn ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Sona bɔ onnwu ebie anwunvoin ne, ye koso bɛbu atɛn a, bɛngonwu ye anwunvo. Anwunvoin kora di ngunim wɔ atɛmmuo nu.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Nniema mɔ, sɛ ebie ka kyɛ ole gyidie, ná olle nyumaa a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ? Aso sɔ gyidie ne kɔhora kole ye ngoa? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Sɛ aliemaa bie nwo la so, ye noa aleɛ abɔ ye, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />na ɛmɔ nu bie ka kyire ye kyɛ, “Fa asomdwie kɔ, wɔ nwo yɛ wɔ hye, na wɔ ko yi.” Nakoso wamma ye bɔ nipadua ne hia a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Sɔ ala yeɛ gyidie koso, sɛ nyumaa bokka so a, né wawu.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ebia ebie kɔha kyɛ, “Ɛle gyidie, yeɛ me koso nne nyumaa.” Kyire me wɔ gyidie bɔ nyumaa bokka so ne, na me koso ngɔfa nyumaa ngohyire wɔ me gyidie. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Edɛ di kyɛ Nyameɛ komapɛ yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ɔ? Ayɛ nikye, sunzummɔne mɔ po de di, na bɛ nwo popo. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Sona bɔ elle adwene, ɛnze kyɛ gyidie bɔ nyumaa bokka so ne, wawu? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Nná nyumaa so yeɛ begyina bɛbule yɛ baba Abraham bem, mmerɛ bɔ ɔfale ɔwa Isaac tole afɔleɛ bokyea so kyɛ ɔfa ye bɔ afɔleɛ ne? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Nnaa anwu kyɛ ɔfale nyumaa bokale ye gyidie so, ɔnate nyumaa so yeɛ ye gyidie lili mu ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Na tworɔnzɛm ne wale nu kyɛ “Abraham nyane gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nu, na bɛbule ye kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ,” na bɛfrɛle ye Nyameɛ damvo. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Ɛhe amaa ɛmɔ anwu ye kyɛ, nyumaa yeɛ begyina so bebu ebie bem ɔ, ná ɔtte gyidie ngome. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Nná sɔ ala yeɛ bɛgyinane nyumaa so bɛbule Rahab bɔ ɔte tuutuuniɛ ne bem, mmerɛ bɔ olɛle mmrienzua bɔ bɛsomane bɛ ne kama, ná ɔmaa bɛfale atee foforɛ so bɛhɔle ne? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Na kyɛbɔ nipadua bɔ honhom<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nwomeɛ.”</char></note> nne nu awu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ gyidie bɔ nyumaa bokka so ne, wawu ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Nniema mɔ, nná ɛmɔ nu biala yeɛ odikyɛ okyirekyire ɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ, yɛ bɔ yɛ kyirekyire ne yeɛ yekonya atemmuo bɔ enu yɛ nno paa ne. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Ofikyɛ yɛ nu biala di mvomsoɛ mmerɛ pee. Sɛ ebie dwudwo na onni mvomsoɛ a, bɔ okyire yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɔ sona ne de, ɔte pɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔnyɛ bɔne.”</char></note> na ɔkora hyɛ ye nipadua namukoraati so. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Yɛfa buralɛ yɛwura mbɔngɔ noa nu maa betie yɛ, na yɛmaa bɛyɛ bɔ yɛkuro biala. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Ɛmɔnea hyep, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ ɔte piri paa, na mvrama kandinga yeɛ ɔkora twe ye ɔ, nakoso bakaa kamba bie yeɛ bɔ otwi hyep ne fa kyire ye atee maa ɔkɔ nekaa bɔ okuro ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Sɔ ala yeɛ temverema koso, ɔte akwaa kaa bie wɔ nipadua nanu, nakoso okyire ye nwo paa. Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ see kaa bie kora yera ɛhɔayɛ pirikua ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Temverema ne koso te see. Ɔte yɛ nipadua akwaa bɔ bɔne ngome yeɛ ɔyɛ ɔ; ɔkora gua nipadua nanwo fiɛ, ɔsɛkye sona abrabɔ, ɔsɛkye nikye te kyɛ <char style="tl">Gehenna</char>. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Ngaka bɔ bɛ nwo yɛ suro, nnomaa, ngaka bɔ bɛkõngõ, ne ɛpo nu ngaka mukoraati, sona kora brɛ bɛ ase, na ofi tete yeɛ batie sona ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Nakoso temverema de, dasaniɛ biala ngora mmrɛ ye ase. Ɔte busueniɛ bɔ bɛmmɔ ye kyɛn so, pɔizen ngome yeɛ ɔwɔ nu ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Temverema he yeɛ yɛfa yɛye Awurade, yɛ Baba ne ayɛ, na ye ala yeɛ yɛfa yɛdome<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛfa yɛwa amoen.”</char></note> mmenia bɔ bayɛ bɛ Nyameɛ suban so ne. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Yɛ noa komapɛ nanu yeɛ nhyira ne nnome fi ba ɔ. Nniema mɔ, ɛhe de, ɔttemaye. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne yahora yanya nzue bɔ ɔyɛ fɛ, ne bɔ ɔyɛ wee yafi neka-horɛ? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Nniema mɔ, aso borɔdoma bakaa kora su olive mmaa? Na bobe kora su borɔdoma? Sɔ ala yeɛ yɛngɔhora yengonya nzue bɔ ɔyɛ fɛ yɛngofi nzue bɔ ɔte ngyee nu ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ ɔse nworɛ, na ɔte edwirɛ bo ɔ? Ma ɔfa ye bra pa ne anwobraseɛ bɔ ofi nyanza nu ne hyire ye nyumaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Nakoso sɛ ahoɔyaa ne pɛsɛmengominya<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Dibea prelɛ.”</char></note> wɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu a, nnɛmaa ɛmɔ hoɔhoa ɛmɔ nwo bɛka kyɛ, ɛmɔse nahorɛ ne. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Sɔ nyanza ne de, offi anwuro, ɔte aseɛ he aso, anwoɔnaen, ne sunzummɔne deɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ofikyɛ nekaa bɔ ahoɔyaa ne pɛsɛmengominya<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Dibea prelɛ.”</char></note> wɔ ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ basabasa ne amumuyɛɛ koso wɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Nyanza bɔ ofi anwuro ne de, bɔ oli moa ne, ye nwo te, okuro asomdwie, ɔte dwirɛ bo, ye so nyɛ se, awunvoin ne bra pa ayi ye tɛkyɛ, ɔnyeye mmenia nu, na ɔtte nyaatwom. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Na bɛdua tenenee mmaa wɔ asomdwie nu bɛma bɛ bɔ bɛpena asomdwie ne.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ngondii ne dwudwolɛ bɔ ɔkɔ so wɔ ɛmɔ nu ne, ofi nisua? Ɛmɔ akɔnnɔ bɔ ɔne ɛmɔ kõ ne, nnaa nu yeɛ ofi ɔ? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Bɔ ɛmɔ konvi wɔ so ne, ɛmɔ nnya ye; ɛmɔdi awue, ɛmɔ nye boro nikye, nakoso bɔ ɛmɔpena ne, ɛmɔ sa nga ye. Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ nwo alapaa, na ɛmɔ kõ, nakoso ɛmɔ sa nga ye, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ mmisa. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Na sɛ ɛmɔ bisa a, ɛmɔ sa nga ye, ofikyɛ nná adwene pa yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛ bisa ɔ. Ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔfa bɛyɛ bɔ ɛmɔ akɔnnɔ kuro ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ sɛkye agyaa ne, ɛmɔnze kyɛ sɛ ɛmɔfa wiase ne adamvoa a, okyire kyɛ ɛmɔtane Nyameɛ? Yeti ebiala bɔ okuro kyɛ ɔfa wiase ne adamvoa ne, né ɔyɛ ye nwo Nyameɛ tamfo. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Anaa ɛmɔse kyɛ mmerɛ bɔ tworɔnzɛm ne hane kyɛ, “Honhom bɔ ɔte yɛ nu ne nye boro nikye” ne, né ɔlaka? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Nakoso adom bɔ wafa wama yɛ ne, ɔsone tra sɔ honhom ne. Yeti, tworɔnzɛm ne ka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">“Nyameɛ si bɛ bɔ bɛte dwɛɛ ne atee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">ná anwobraseɛfoɛ de, ɔdo bɛ.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Yeti ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛwura Nyameɛ bo. Ɛmɔsi Abɔnzam atee, na ɔkɔnwati kofi ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Ɛmɔpingye Nyameɛ, na ye koso okopingye ɛmɔ. Abɔnefoɛ, ɛmɔnwunzi ɛmɔ sa; ná ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ nyɔ-nyɔ ne, ɛmɔte ɛmɔ ahone nu. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ɛmɔli yealɛ, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ wora bɔ, ná ɛmɔsu; ɛmɔma ɛmɔ serelɛ kakyi aworaborɛ, na ɛmɔ anigye kakyi esue. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase wɔ Awurade nyunu, na ɔkɔma ɛmɔ so.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Aliemaa mɔ, nnɛmɔ dwudwo betia ɛmɔ nwo kõ. Ebiala bɔ odwudwo tia oliema anaa obu ye atɛn ne, wadwudwo watia mmeraa ne, ná wabu mmera ne atɛn. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Bɔ ɔkora hyɛ mmera ma yɛ, na obu yɛ atɛn ne te komapɛ, ye ala yeɛ ɔkora de ngoa, na ɔsɛkye ebie ɔ. Yeti wɔ yeɛ ele nwa, bɔ ebu eliema atɛn?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Ɛmɔtie, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛyɛ a ɛmɔka kyɛ: “Ɛnɛ anaa ɛhema, yɛkɔtu atee yɛkɔhɔ kuro he aso yɛkooli afoɛ, na yayɛ adwuma yanya mvasoɛ,” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />nakoso bɔ okosi ɛhema po ne, ɛmɔnze ne. Ɛmɔ ngoa te kyɛ nwosina, ɔba mmerɛ kaa bie, né wamini. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Mmom, odikyɛ ɛmɔka kyɛ: “Sɛ Awurade boka na yɛte ngoa nu a, yɛkɔyɛ ɛhe anaa ɛhe.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔkeka edwirɛ mbiri-mbiri bɛfa bɛhoɔhoa ɛmɔ nwo. Sɔ ahohoɔhoa namukoraati te bɔne. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔse pa na ɔnyɛ ne, ɔte bɔne ma ye.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Afei asikafoɛ, ɛmɔtie; amaneɛ bɔ ɔba ɛmɔ so nati, ɛmɔsu na ɛmɔpɛ awuye. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Ɛmɔ ahonyadeɛ ne aporɔ, na mvrɔlɔ ali ɛmɔ ndadeɛ nemɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ɛmɔ sikaa kɔkorɛ ne ɛmɔ kɔɔbere nemɔ awe naakye, na sɔ naakye ne kɔyɛ adanzeɛ kotia ɛmɔ, na okoli ɛmɔ naen. Bɔ ɛmɔ aboɔboa ye noa ne kɔyɛ kyɛ see wɔ awieɛ mmerɛ nanu. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Nea, apaafoɛ bɔ bɛyɛle ɛmɔ boo nanu adwuma ne, b'akatua bɔ ɛmmɔ amva amma bɛ ne, osu frɛ ɛmɔ, na apaafoɛ nemɔ sue ne adwu asafo Awurade so anu. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Ɛmɔ nyane asetena pa wɔ aseɛ he aso, na ɛmɔ buli ahohwibra. Ɛmɔ adidi bayɛ twɔtwɔfee te kyɛ ngaka bɔ bɛkwaahu bɛ ne. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Ɛmɔ abu teneneeniɛ fɔ bahu ye; aso Ɔne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ “Nyameɛ ne.”</char></note> ɛmɔ ngoli anaa?<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Nniema mɔ, ɛmɔnya aboterɛ bɛnwondɛ Awurade kyẽa ne. Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ kuaniɛ nwondɛ ma aseɛ kye aleɛ bɔ ɔsom bo ne; onya aboterɛ nwondɛ kyɛ nzue bɔ oli moa, ne nzue bɔ ɔpɛ yebo kɔtɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnya aboterɛ na ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye, ofikyɛ Awurade kyẽa ne apingye. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Nniema mɔ, nnɛmaa ɛmɔ nwiinwii betia ɛmɔ nwo, na bammu ɛmɔ atɛn. Ofikyɛ bɔ okobu atɛn ne gyi anoa ne si berɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Aliemaa mɔ, adiifoɛ bɔ bɛ dwudwole wɔ Awurade dumaa nu ne, ɛmɔsua nikye bie bɛfi b'amanehunu ne b'aboterɛ nanu. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ɛmɔtie, bɛ bɔ bɛmiane bɛ nye bɛfale amaneɛ nu ne, yɛbu bɛ kyɛ bɛle anigye. Nnaa ɛmɔ ate Job animia nanwo dwirɛ, ná ɛmɔ nwuni bɔ Awurade maa ofili nu wale ne. Ɛhe amaa ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ Awurade le ahunu-ndetelɛ, na onwu anwunvoin.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛhe mukoraati si ne, nnɛmɔ ta ndaen! Nnɛmɔfa anwuro, aseɛ, anaa nikye foforɛ biala bɛta ndaen. Ɛmɔ de, sɛ ɛmɔka “Yoo” a, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ yoo, na sɛ “Daabi” koso a, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ daabi, ná bammu ɛmɔ atɛn.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ɛmɔ nu bie nwu amaneɛ? Ma ɔbɔ mbaeɛ. Ebie nye agye? Ma ɔto ayɛyie dwein. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Ɛmɔ nu bie nde apɔ? Ma ɔfrɛ asafo nanu mbanyi ma bɛbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma ye, ná bɛfa ngoo bɛgua ye so wɔ Awurade dumaa nu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Gyidie mbaeɛ ne kole bɔ ɔnde apɔ ne ngoa, na Awurade kɔpagya ye; na sɛ wayɛ bɔne bie a, ɔkɔfa kɔhyɛ ye. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Yeti, ɛmɔkeka ɛmɔ bɔne behyire ɛmɔ nwo, na ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma ɛmɔ nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ nwo kɔtɔ ɛmɔ ɔ. Sɛ teneneeniɛ mbaeɛ yɛ adwuma a, tumi wɔ nu paa. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Né Elia te sona te kyɛ yɛ ala, nakoso ɔbɔle mbaeɛ kyɛ nnɛmaa nzue tɔ, na nzue andɔ aseɛ naso afoɛ nza ne bosome nzia. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Afei, osa bɔle mbaeɛ, na nzue tɔle maa aseɛ ne bɔle ye aleɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Nniema mɔ, sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie twe ye nwo fi nahorɛ nanwo, na ebie sa fa ye ba a, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />ɛmɔkaye kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔhwe ɔbɔnefoɛ kofi atee bɔ ɔttemaye so ne, okole ye kofi ewue nu, na ɔkɔkata bɔne pee so.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>